# Fabric API convention tags (Fabric's `c:` namespace) that Farmer's Delight Refabricated relies on but does
# not define itself: on Fabric, Fabric API ships them; Horizon ships none. Members are the vanilla items
# Fabric's conventional tags v2 list for 26.3. Generated into data/c/tags/item by tools/gen_conventional_tags.py.
# Biome tags (c:is_beach, c:is_hot/overworld, c:is_mushroom, c:is_underground, c:is_wet/overworld) come with M6.

